<a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, Appendix B §§B.2–B.4 print151–158; independent one-sided finite-multiset encoding; Supplement Girard, Linear Logic, TCS 50 (1987), cut-elimination theorem"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{LL},R_0,\\vdash_{LL},\\vdash_{LL}^0\">\\(R_{LL},R_0,\\vdash_{LL},\\vdash_{LL}^0\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的完整命题经典LL（含四单位、加法及指数）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\\quad(\\vdash_{LL}\\Gamma\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{LL}^0\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\\quad(\\vdash_{LL}\\Gamma\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{LL}^0\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0\\cup R_{cut})=\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0\\cup R_{cut})=\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是cut的可容许性/无cut证明存在定理，不宣称任意人为指定的证明归约策略都强正规化。来源陈述资格保留；指数主cut需按收缩复制、promotion旁条件处理，不能仅由MLL proof-net的终止性证明整个LL结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M$；$R_{LL},R_0,\\vdash_{LL},\\vdash_{LL}^0$ 使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的完整命题经典LL（含四单位、加法及指数）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"R_{LL},R_0,\\vdash_{LL},\\vdash_{LL}^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M\\quad(\\vdash_{LL}\\Gamma\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\vdash_{LL}^0\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0\\cup R_{cut})=\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_{LL}}(R_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination|thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination — Linear Logic Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination|thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination — Linear Logic Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination|72-thm-linear-logic-cut-elimination]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}